<title>AUSTRIA: Wienerberger details 1996 results.</title>
<headline>Wienerberger details 1996 results.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ending December 31, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of schillings unless stated)</p>
<p>						    1996	1995</p>
<p> SALES					   15,061.2  12,855.0</p>
<p>   Wall, ceiling and roofing systems    7,724     4,917</p>
<p>   Pipe systems, sewage technology	3,396     3,238</p>
<p>   Treibacher				   3,485     4,267</p>
<p>   Real estate				    456	 433</p>
<p> EBIT					     1,601.9   1,674.4</p>
<p> PRETAX PROFIT				  1,369.4   1,495.5</p>
<p>   Wall, ceiling and roofing systems	689	 882</p>
<p>   Pipe and sewage technology		 128	 168</p>
<p>   Treibacher				     174	 155</p>
<p>   Real estate				    378	 290</p>
<p> EXTRAORDINARY ITEMS			   -171.4    -102.2</p>
<p> TAXES					     -396.8    -277.8</p>
<p> NET PROFIT					 801.2   1,115.5</p>
<p> INVESTMENTS				    2,395     2,834</p>
<p> PERSONNEL COSTS				3,517.0   2,737.4</p>
<p> EMPLOYEES					8,229     6,418</p>
<p> EPS (schillings)				 104	 168</p>
<p> DIVIDEND PER SHARE (schillings)	     42	  42</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company is Wienerberger Baustoffindustrie AG .</p>
<p>The company said it expected 1997 pre-tax profit to rise 24 percent to around 1.7 billion schillings as overall conditions in the European buildings material industry improved.</p>
<p>-- Vienna newsroom, +431 53112 274</p>
</text>
